  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023 oPt Emergency Appeal - Gaza - Emergency Cash-for-Work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through its cash-for-work (CfW) intervention, UNRWA will support Palestine refugees in coping with the protracted economic crisis, contributing to mitigate food insecurity by offering short-term employment opportunities to approximately 46,000 poor Palestine refugees. This translates into more than 4,600,000 workdays generating almost 16,000 full time job equivalents and injecting US$ 59 million into the local economy.</narrative>
  </description>
